Package: com.vusys.wallpaperparallax
Name: Wallpaper Parallax
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Parallax wallpaper scrolling for iOS 6, like Android. Renders its own SBWallpaperView instance instead of transforming the stock one, so app-open/close transitions no longer fight our pan.
Maintainer: Vusys
Author: Vusys
Section: Tweaks
